The data in this directory is released under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), with the following exception.

`derived/corpus_restricted_keys.jsonl` contains no source text. The identifiers, hashes and
positional fields in it are released under CC BY 4.0, but the underlying Van Gogh and
Whistler letter texts are not covered by this licence and are not distributed here. See
README.md for the rights position of each source.

Model outputs in ../runs/ are released under CC BY 4.0.
